flowchart LR
  OUTSIDE[Untrusted Meta advisory output] --> PARSE[Strict parse and numeric allowlist]
  PARSE --> LIMIT[Per-key bounds + directional checks]
  LIMIT --> REVIEW{Policy / budget / compatibility}
  REVIEW -->|Approved| PATCH[Versioned YAML only]
  REVIEW -->|Rejected| AUDIT[Audit and deterministic fallback]
  PATCH --> TEST[Revalidation and tests]
  TEST -->|Pass| LAUNCH[Schedule controlled attempt]
  TEST -->|Fail| AUDIT
  LAUNCH --> EVAL[Held-out eval + human/automatic gate]
